I reach the office and open my laptop.
My colleague Priya comes near my desk.
She is working on a new design.
"Maya, are you busy right now?" Priya asks.
"No, I am not busy."
"Please sit," I say.
Priya places her laptop on the desk.
We look at the new user interface screens.
"I changed the colors here," Priya says.
"Is this alright?" she asks.
"Yes, this is excellent."
"I will write its code today," I say.
We quickly discuss our tasks.
A few weeks ago, this big project was very stressful.
Back then, we worked late at night every day.
But now, this is just our normal everyday work.
I am not worried anymore.
Priya closes the laptop, and then we go to drink tea.
